[{"title":"梦綵堂","author":"虞堪","text":"高堂白发不胜簪，尚有天涯游子吟。\n老莱斑衣每入梦，春晖寸草难为心。\n万里关山阻南国，五色凤凰鸣上林。\n东风几度桐江绿，蝴蝶飞来春已深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21322,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野人家","author":"虞堪","text":"野人还住野人家，好在山颠与水涯。\n不以红尘干世事，却于青草识年华。\n门前夜雨生新涨，屋上春风捲落花。\n只有渔樵来会酒，歌呼每到月西斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21323,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看帆四首 其四","author":"虞堪","text":"经过滟滪汎瞿唐，天险何如地险长。\n我爱越山投剡曲，君看吴水忆襄阳。\n季鹰思鲙乘高兴，司马探书念远乡。\n不是烟尘迷锦里，也还鸥燕逐牙樯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21324,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题吴江孙氏小隐湖楼","author":"虞堪","text":"太湖三万六千顷，小楼寻常盈丈间。\n高情自寄烟水阔，长啸不惊鸥鹭閒。\n白日看云当槛过，清宵放月照琴还。\n谁家燕子空缭绕，惟待秋风坠绿鬟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21325,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"心远楼为瀚上人赋并发同席郑明府一笑","author":"虞堪","text":"东吴胜地黄山麓，北海上人心远楼。\n闲爱白云飞海峤，静听春雨过沧洲。\n复公诗好不可压，郑老官馀曾共游。\n荠滑笋肥加晚饭，得参世外有扬州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21326,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪篷轩为式上人赋","author":"虞堪","text":"忆棹扁舟渡海东，海风吹雪洒寒篷。\n恍如屋里生虚白，谁共无边说幻空。\n暂对鸥盟忘绿渚，更探龙藏入珠宫。\n而今别在青岩畔，戏玩云泉去住同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21327,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"如舟亭为沈子和氏赋松雪翁所书扁","author":"虞堪","text":"东老作亭东海头，开窗盘礴坐如舟。\n花飞酒幔云高捲，竹映书签水乱流。\n留客可看清剡雪，学仙应过洞庭秋。\n只从占得鸥波渌，却笑王孙赋远游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21328,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安素处士畴隐次郑遂昌韵","author":"虞堪","text":"沧海扬尘澒洞时，茫茫白日闪朱旗。\n田间勿怪小结屋，世上更谁能采芝。\n烟雨荒村归牧竖，风波极浦见渔师。\n清晨出耕晚入息，三尺黄鱼足办炊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21329,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新岁次韵沈存斋","author":"虞堪","text":"满卜今年见小康，莫疑蓍短复龟长。\n野鸥久识沧洲趣，海鹤终期寥廓翔。\n日转山河蟠淑气，春回草树发天香。\n先生自种门前柳，已似新鹅与酒黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21330,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵朱北窗阻雨留江馆对榻","author":"虞堪","text":"落花如海乱西东，绿水青山旧日同。\n无奈春光轻易晚，不知行路几时通。\n竹深野鸟频呼雨，浪滚江豚正转风。\n苦欲留君休解缆，剪灯联榻话飘蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21331,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答甬东方彦脩见寄并柬徐生","author":"虞堪","text":"避地每承先枉问，躬耕无计服勤劬。\n兵戈南北家千里，风雨蒹葭海一隅。\n故旧岂闻真国士，笑谈唯爱老渔夫。\n烦君为觅蓬莱路，徐福楼船近有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21332,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵陆高士见寄","author":"虞堪","text":"美人相别意何长，世路悠悠曲似肠。\n军马野中犹格斗，渔船江上亦凄凉。\n连年甫里同茶灶，何日成都问草堂。\n惆怅沙鸥随所适，东飘西泊似无乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21333,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答阮维则","author":"虞堪","text":"蹇予十载漂沦客，奈此一春风雨何。\n泥没畏途人迹断，草掀荒屋漏痕多。\n长怀鸟道行行险，却著骡纲事事驮。\n万里穷愁逢阮籍，竹林虽近未能过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21334,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答王性中","author":"虞堪","text":"华馆春风昔往来，翻成车鞅逐尘埃。\n狂游自讶飞龙剑，落魄浑忘花鸽杯。\n天地一沤身未老，关河万里路还开。\n欲将短笛吹佳调，又惜江城玉树梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21335,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九斗群峰飞翠寒仙人居处最高安每看直下沧溟小长立危尖宇宙宽一自两凫从远迈数番双鲤奉馀欢而今带月吹笙去海晏尘清更不难","author":"虞堪","text":"捲地东风暗落花，倚风聊侧帽檐纱。\n十分春事多成梦，半百年华只谩嗟。\n诗酒纵凭知己诮，才情浑好著谁誇。\n考功宅畔潮通海，便欲乘桴莫问家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21336,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵海上还","author":"虞堪","text":"问君何处觅玄洲，还作东方海上游。\n瑶草只从方士寄，蟠桃那许世人谋。\n尘飞恍惚千年劫，槎转虚空八月秋。\n但怪晨光多变见，元龙不是蜃为楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21337,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕彦贞以诗见寄江舍次韵奉答 其一","author":"虞堪","text":"失笑自甘成野老，放歌犹复哀王孙。\n十年兵阻西蜀道，九月霜雨东吴门。\n?裂布袍懒适市，萧条茇舍还依村。\n何缘处处无酒卖，故人数来空与论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21338,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕彦贞以诗见寄江舍次韵奉答 其二","author":"虞堪","text":"白石先生多逸情，寄来好句如弥明。\n空江落木秋正下，流水行云日自生。\n神人忽张洞庭乐，老将复捷燕山兵。\n雄深雅健何可得，我一把咏身如轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21339,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵坚上人秋怀","author":"虞堪","text":"曾策羸骖笑独骞，秋风瑟缩楚南天。\n好诗都拾奚囊里，得句频过佛寺前。\n坐傲浮云栖乱叶，生憎急管杂繁弦。\n而今头白心如水，惟有愁情到极边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21340,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"用先叔祖韵寿薛鹤斋道人","author":"虞堪","text":"练海秋风若捲涛，辽天得与鹤同遨。\n人间不老三花树，天上初分五色桃。\n甲子每书聊自记，姓名千载复谁逃。\n等閒谈笑重阳近，又向樽前一举螯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21341,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"招鹤辞","author":"袁华","text":"胎仙翱翔兮蕊珠之宫，薄云汉兮溘埃风。\n乘火精兮自养，抱贞素兮气内充。\n朝扶摇兮丹丘，夕裴徊兮玄圃。\n繄故国兮丘墟，冢累累兮下土。\n蕊珠之宫兮胎仙翱翔，美婵媛兮玄衣缟裳。\n迟夫君兮未来，揽青田兮璚芳。\n长夜漫漫兮窅不见日，子哀鸣兮血化为碧。\n蕙帐空兮猿惊，心旁皇兮反侧。\n新亭兮桓桓郁郁，佳城兮松柏丸丸。\n疏玉泉兮交流，树琅玕兮为樊。\n山川绸缪兮道里阻脩，陆有虎豹兮江有潜虬。\n胎仙翱翔兮归休，玄间窈冥兮不可以久留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21342,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答孟章省元","author":"虞堪","text":"文章得失寸心知，千载寥寥竟属谁。\n天象昭回云汉表，人文宣朗古今宜。\n凤鸣阿阁雄诸籁，蝉响悲风引一丝。\n之子有才良自得，关雎麟笔玩多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21343,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哀宋姬","author":"袁华","text":"膏吾车以北征兮，邅黄龙之故城。\n山川蚴蟉以郁盘兮，维完颜氏之所京。\n系二世之雄特兮，日从事乎兵革。\n何靖康之蒙尘兮，身降庶而窜谪。\n粤王枢之有女兮，亦俘累而在行。\n符玉文之印谶兮，充下陈兮椒房。\n甘委命而尽节兮，羌陨身而奚益。\n俟事机之可乘兮，虽九死而不惜。\n胡宋祚之中衰兮，徙二帝于穷山之阴。\n昧大义而共戴天兮，荃不愧于中心。\n陈谠言之謇謇兮，矢弗从而继以死也。\n何彼苍之不鉴其忠诚兮，竟损生于匕首也。\n噫吁戏天乎不仁兮俾独撄其荼毒，父为虏兮国随覆。\n身既死兮雠不能复，谋弗克兮为大僇。\n哀幽愤兮不平，河流汤汤兮征鸿肃肃。\n金源兮走鹿，祐陵兮拱木。\n陈吾辞兮吊贞淑，魂其归来兮故国。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21344,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"施架阁池上夜饮联句","author":"虞堪","text":"槽头醁醑倒不尽，池上梅花开欲齐。\n今日好怀良足慰，百年高兴若为题。\n银灯绚席珊瑚烂，綵笔联诗锦绣迷。\n细雨作花檐际落，清歌如缕拍中低。\n浑忘司马青衫湿，似听宫莺绿树啼。\n公子金猊烧笃耨，美人犀筋劝驼啼。\n也知北海能豪杰，况有东方善滑稽。\n腰细舞低翻弱柳，手纤杯重压柔荑。\n先判五夜同倾倒，未信三边尚鼓鼙。\n倏忽年华梁旦暮，风流人物晋东西。\n江湖空阔鸿偏到，梧竹高低凤独栖。\n乘兴放船来笠泽，散愁投辖忆浔溪。\n襟期久矣交如漆，笑谑颓然醉似泥。\n潮涨空滩移舴艋，雨晴何处看凫鹥。\n会须发达摅忧愤，慎勿登临动惨悽。\n失喜今宵是何夕，酒阑起舞忽闻鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21345,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西蜀 其一","author":"虞堪","text":"西蜀青山青似眉，连云芳树杜鹃飞。\n垆头酒熟樱桃过，万里桥西人未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21346,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西蜀 其二","author":"虞堪","text":"春风画舸锦江上，细雨朱樱红树中。\n买得白鱼剩沽酒，丈人相对倒郫筒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21347,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉垒词","author":"虞堪","text":"玉垒峰头月落西，碧鸡祠下杜鹃啼。\n江南倦客多归思，忆踏扁舟泛五溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21348,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三峡词","author":"虞堪","text":"雪浪西来常滚滚，云涛东去自茫茫。\n宁知万叠关山恨，比似难牵百丈长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21349,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"锦官","author":"虞堪","text":"锦官城外山如画，春雨飞花红满川。\n人过旧垆还问酒，鱼来丙穴不论钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21350,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"虞堪","text":"想凤停针刺绣纹，沈沈别殿锁重门。\n棠梨枝上三更月，雪色冰轮不见痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21351,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思","author":"虞堪","text":"美人不来眇何许，路傍芳草绿萋萋。\n桃花春浪半篙浅，恨隔三千弱水西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谩兴 其一 除夜","author":"虞堪","text":"出门无路达天衢，谩拥寒衾咄咄书。\n岁月又随更漏尽，半生孤愤不能除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谩兴 其二 元日","author":"虞堪","text":"帝所新正尽早朝，万方无乃寸心劳。\n野人空老江湖表，梦绕钧天日已高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谩兴 其三 人日","author":"虞堪","text":"草堂人日倚吟筇，日出阴消见远峰。\n但愿八荒春盎盎，尽无争斗即为农。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谩兴 其四 元夜","author":"虞堪","text":"鳌山月在沧江冷，蛟室潮生贝阙寒。\n闲却锦囊双凤琯，玉人何许夜漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴 其一","author":"虞堪","text":"甫里祠前春雨晴，阖庐浦口海潮生。\n白鸥聚处蒲芽短，惊起轻轻荡桨鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴 其二","author":"虞堪","text":"几阵飞花扑高树，一声啼鸟正当门。\n閒拈綵笔无题处，写得江南过雨痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴 其三","author":"虞堪","text":"夕阳半落乌衣巷，春树多迷绿野堂。\n无事山樵虽不出，也愁风雨暗高岗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴 其五","author":"虞堪","text":"桑条齐绿柳毵毵，又见人家卜养蚕。\n到处落花随雨后，半分春色在江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴 其六","author":"虞堪","text":"西塞山边吹战尘，南阳原上草如茵。\n谁将宋玉伤春句，说向登临感慨人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春述怀 其六","author":"虞堪","text":"河边残雪未全销，怪底春来暖尚遥。\n好待东风剪芳草，马蹄踏遍赤阑桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花下把酒","author":"虞堪","text":"一百五日正欲暮，三月尽头犹是春。\n把酒对花须大醉，人间谁主复谁宾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴 其一","author":"虞堪","text":"詹尹如何为卜休，闲身犹住海边楼。\n一春风雨知多少，花落莺啼并作愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴下口占","author":"虞堪","text":"吴王城下水连村，梅雨新晴海雾昏。\n谁复吹箫市朝变，夕阳芳草断人魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"越来溪","author":"虞堪","text":"每踏扁舟过越来，青山何处复登台。\n野花荆棘多迷恨，空逐寒沙白鸟回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过王季野妻施夫人墓因怀季野","author":"虞堪","text":"宝玦珠奁土一抔，东风原上使人愁。\n落花寂寂迷芳草，日暮王孙何处游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"升公兰若","author":"虞堪","text":"莫笑长来过虎溪，逃禅吃酒醉如泥。\n桃花落处看春色，杨柳阴中听鸟啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21368,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登天池山发在公一笑","author":"虞堪","text":"行穷水色与山光，觅得灵源到上方。\n蹑断翠厓云汉上，坐扪参井濯沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21369,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为在公赋石屋","author":"虞堪","text":"石屋都无斧凿痕，捾来元是一浑沦。\n借师猊座盘礴裸，开出维摩不二门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题浑沦庵","author":"虞堪","text":"龙虎山中看月高，静无天籁绝纤毫。\n浑沦消息谁知得，夜半吹笙醉碧桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄湖州潘公颖","author":"虞堪","text":"看花长想曲江春，燕子东风聚散频。\n君向水精宫里住，题诗还近玉堂人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄王明仲","author":"虞堪","text":"西湖何处好题诗，落日西泠唱竹枝。\n团扇晚停眉黛敛，水寒休弄玉参差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠笔生温子敬","author":"虞堪","text":"铦锋淬锷未由降，梦底生花愧老江。\n要见太平无事日，杀青书里作长杠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠墨客","author":"虞堪","text":"千金买赋不买墨，墨重万金识者稀。\n卿操绝艺待良史，著弊江南旧布衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送达明善还嘉兴","author":"虞堪","text":"鲈鱼鲙斫樽无醁，阿滥堆成笛正愁。\n昨夜凉风吹得苦，莫传离思入南州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遗陈生","author":"虞堪","text":"流莺罗扇夜徘徊，望断银河鹊未来。\n何处海门潮送月，几年空照越王台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读何水部诗集","author":"虞堪","text":"剪烛联诗孰似君，多情无奈沈休文。\n扬州春月应无夜，祇为梅花瘦几分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示陈起","author":"虞堪","text":"故人违我作仙游，世上应无百尺楼。\n一见凤毛翚五彩，尚思谈笑说吴钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留客听琴","author":"虞堪","text":"楼中伯也兴不浅，座上中郎心欲归。\n晓蝶几番和梦去，秋鸿逐段拍波飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遗陈童子","author":"虞堪","text":"涌金门外秋如海，笑指青天白玉盘。\n此地别来添两岁，姮娥还怯夜潮寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答郑长卿见寄","author":"虞堪","text":"沧江梅子雨丝丝，谷口书来念远期。\n爱道不官耕隐去，但悲风木起哀思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为宏行者画萱草","author":"虞堪","text":"宏兄身在空花室，梦幻无边苦忆亲。\n要认东风真面目，直教重见北堂春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为规侍者画天台图","author":"虞堪","text":"风雨祇园夜寂寥，对僧燃烛画山椒。\n眼明认得天台路，有个行人到石桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题十六应真图","author":"虞堪","text":"人人元自有神通，步步都行怖畏空。\n不是脚跟能踏实，如何到得大江东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陶靖节赋诗像","author":"虞堪","text":"归来不负酒并琴，幽鸟南山伴好吟。\n一自卷中书甲子，钓璜千古不同心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题诸葛武侯草庐像","author":"虞堪","text":"天挺神明不世姿，当时出处系安危。\n三分事势劳筹笔，未出隆中也自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21387,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秋山楼观图","author":"虞堪","text":"万朵芙蓉在屋头，白云堆里见层楼。\n题诗忽忆云门寺，几度寻僧八月游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21388,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宣和马图","author":"虞堪","text":"龙姿凤质满中原，尽蹴秋风度海门。\n一匹不来践霜雪，沙场青草自黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21389,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题施雅山所藏宋端孝公主所赋桂花诗便面手卷后就用其韵三首 其一","author":"虞堪","text":"一一方诸镜样团，金壶沾墨岂无端。\n万年枝上天香尽，遗恨青天碧海寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":21390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]